{
    "title": "Readink - Read Good Web Novel",
    "description": "We are Readink - Best Web Novels & Romance Stories reading app for readers!\r\n- Book Genres: Werewolf, Billionaire, Fantasy, Mystery, Alpha, Sci-Fi, Horror and more.\r\n- Vast Collection of over 50,000+ Novels from top-selling authors.\r\nYou can find and read the newest novel, hottest story, and best-seller web novel here!\r\n\r\nMillions of novel and book readers are obsessed with romance stories in Readink. Just reach for your phone to read good novels online anytime, anywhere!\r\nDownload Readink reading app now and start a new webnovel journey!\r\n\r\n\u2728Cover All Kinds of Good Novels\r\nReadink has web novels in various genres of any story to read, which could satisfy readers' different preferences.\r\n\r\n*Werewolf\r\n*Romance\r\n*Billionaire\r\n*Urban\r\n*Science Fiction\r\n*Horror\r\n*Adventure\r\n\r\nSo your reading desire can be satisfied to the greatest extent.\r\nRead good novel of your favorite style right away!\r\n\r\n\u2728Add Your Favorite Novels to Read in Our ebook Library\r\n- Build your personal book library by collecting your favorite novel.\r\n- Reading progress will be saved, and every novel will be kept properly for you.\r\n- Support offline reading to meet your reading desire.\r\n\r\n\u2728Personalized Reading Experience\r\n- You will be recommended with good novel and book according to your preferences!\r\n- There are multiple novel genres to read. Personalize your own reading style with them!\r\n- Thoughtful UI design to help protect your eays, care about your reading experience.\r\n- What's more, you can choose to turn pages in the way you like to read!\r\n- With the unique Bookmark function, you can record your reading thoughts anytime.\r\n- With the power saving mode, you can enjoy a longer reading time on Readink!\r\n\r\n\u2728A Paradise for Readers and Authors\r\n- Readink attracts a large number of readers and authors to read. Speak freely in the comments section and share your thoughts with other fans of your favorite book.\r\n- No matter what type of novel you love to read, you can find like-minded novel fans here!\r\n\r\n\u2728Share Your Story\r\n- Readink provides a platform for those who like to share their stories.\r\nJoin us! Unleash your imagination, create your own story and find readers for your works!\r\nLooking forward to working with you!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcdaRead Trending Web Novels at Readink\r\n\ud83d\udd25\u300c King of the Underworld\u300d By RJ Kane\r\n\ud83d\udd25\u300cFour or Dead\u300dBy G O A\r\n\ud83d\udd25\u300cThe Alpha King's Human Mate\u300dBy HC Dolores\r\n\ud83d\udd25\u300cFates Hands\u300dBy Lori Ameling\r\n\ud83d\udd25\u300cThe War God's Favorite\u300dBy Jenny Fox \ud83e\udd8a\r\n\ud83d\udd25\u300cWerewolf's Heartsong \u300dBy DizzyIzzyN\r\n\ud83d\udd25\u300cThe Last Spirit Wolf\u300dBy Elena Norwood\r\n\ud83d\udd25\u300cBetween the Four Alphas\u300dBy K. K. Winter\r\n\r\n---------- Our Novelist -----------\r\nOur invited authors are from quality online fiction platforms such as: Wattpad, Tumblr, Audible, GoodReads, Radish, WebNovel, Patreon, Dreame, Joyread, Yonder, Inkitt, GoodNovel, AlphaNovel, Galatea, NovelCat Fiverr, Medium, Reedsy.\r\n\r\nAs a brand new web novel platform for original fiction book, we are grateful for the support of so many novelist. At the same time, Readink is also working hard to explore an independent online fiction direction, so please join us and make reading more valuable.\r\n\r\n--------- Contact Us ----------\r\n\r\nDownload Readink reading app and indulge in your fantasy dreame novel world NOW!\r\nIf you have any queries, feedbacks or suggestions, our customer service support@readink.app is ready to help.",
    "descriptionHTML": "We are Readink - Best Web Novels &amp; Romance Stories reading app for readers!<br>- Book Genres: Werewolf, Billionaire, Fantasy, Mystery, Alpha, Sci-Fi, Horror and more.<br>- Vast Collection of over 50,000+ Novels from top-selling authors.<br>You can find and read the newest novel, hottest story, and best-seller web novel here!<br><br>Millions of novel and book readers are obsessed with romance stories in Readink. Just reach for your phone to read good novels online anytime, anywhere!<br>Download Readink reading app now and start a new webnovel journey!<br><br>\u2728Cover All Kinds of Good Novels<br>Readink has web novels in various genres of any story to read, which could satisfy readers&#39; different preferences.<br><br>*Werewolf<br>*Romance<br>*Billionaire<br>*Urban<br>*Science Fiction<br>*Horror<br>*Adventure<br><br>So your reading desire can be satisfied to the greatest extent.<br>Read good novel of your favorite style right away!<br><br>\u2728Add Your Favorite Novels to Read in Our ebook Library<br>- Build your personal book library by collecting your favorite novel.<br>- Reading progress will be saved, and every novel will be kept properly for you.<br>- Support offline reading to meet your reading desire.<br><br>\u2728Personalized Reading Experience<br>- You will be recommended with good novel and book according to your preferences!<br>- There are multiple novel genres to read. Personalize your own reading style with them!<br>- Thoughtful UI design to help protect your eays, care about your reading experience.<br>- What&#39;s more, you can choose to turn pages in the way you like to read!<br>- With the unique Bookmark function, you can record your reading thoughts anytime.<br>- With the power saving mode, you can enjoy a longer reading time on Readink!<br><br>\u2728A Paradise for Readers and Authors<br>- Readink attracts a large number of readers and authors to read. Speak freely in the comments section and share your thoughts with other fans of your favorite book.<br>- No matter what type of novel you love to read, you can find like-minded novel fans here!<br><br>\u2728Share Your Story<br>- Readink provides a platform for those who like to share their stories.<br>Join us! Unleash your imagination, create your own story and find readers for your works!<br>Looking forward to working with you!<br><br>\ud83d\udcdaRead Trending Web Novels at Readink<br>\ud83d\udd25\u300c King of the Underworld\u300d By RJ Kane<br>\ud83d\udd25\u300cFour or Dead\u300dBy G O A<br>\ud83d\udd25\u300cThe Alpha King&#39;s Human Mate\u300dBy HC Dolores<br>\ud83d\udd25\u300cFates Hands\u300dBy Lori Ameling<br>\ud83d\udd25\u300cThe War God&#39;s Favorite\u300dBy Jenny Fox \ud83e\udd8a<br>\ud83d\udd25\u300cWerewolf&#39;s Heartsong \u300dBy DizzyIzzyN<br>\ud83d\udd25\u300cThe Last Spirit Wolf\u300dBy Elena Norwood<br>\ud83d\udd25\u300cBetween the Four Alphas\u300dBy K. K. Winter<br><br>---------- Our Novelist -----------<br>Our invited authors are from quality online fiction platforms such as: Wattpad, Tumblr, Audible, GoodReads, Radish, WebNovel, Patreon, Dreame, Joyread, Yonder, Inkitt, GoodNovel, AlphaNovel, Galatea, NovelCat Fiverr, Medium, Reedsy.<br><br>As a brand new web novel platform for original fiction book, we are grateful for the support of so many novelist. At the same time, Readink is also working hard to explore an independent online fiction direction, so please join us and make reading more valuable.<br><br>--------- Contact Us ----------<br><br>Download Readink reading app and indulge in your fantasy dreame novel world NOW!<br>If you have any queries, feedbacks or suggestions, our customer service support@readink.app is ready to help.",
